{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"fangji-e-d86957bec0c5d670b546","title":"管辂后得休过清河倪太守，时天旱倪问辂雨期；辂曰今夕当雨，是日畅燥昼无形似，府丞及令在坐咸谓不然；到鼓一中星月皆没、风云并起，竟成快雨；倪盛修主人礼共为欢乐","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-d86957bec0c5d670b546","label":"正文","text":"管辂后得休过清河倪太守，时天旱倪问辂雨期；辂曰今夕当雨，是日畅燥昼无形似，府丞及令在坐咸谓不然；到鼓一中星月皆没、风云并起，竟成快雨；倪盛修主人礼共为欢乐","evidence":["fangji-q-d8f1730852cfc1bd6e0f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"fangji-p-f06456c2a8f978","role":"占者","evidence":["fangji-q-d8f1730852cfc1bd6e0f"]},{"person":"fangji-p-ecb23577738870","role":"问雨者","evidence":["fangji-q-d8f1730852cfc1bd6e0f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-d8f1730852cfc1bd6e0f"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-d8f1730852cfc1bd6e0f","order":6062}],"persons":[{"id":"fangji-p-ecb23577738870","name":"倪氏（清河太守）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"fangji-p-f06456c2a8f978","name":"管辂","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-d8f1730852cfc1bd6e0f","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-ddd35389fdfa3c204e0a","layer":"original","quote":"后得休〖12〗，过清河倪太守。时天旱，倪问辂雨期。辂曰：“今夕当雨。”是日畅燥〖13〗，昼无形似〖14〗；府丞及令在坐〖15〗，咸谓不然。到鼓一中〖16〗，星月皆没；风云并起，竟成快雨〖17〗。于是倪盛修主人礼〖18〗，共为欢乐","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":414,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
